Build a Membership Management Portal for a small charity organization with the following specifications:

---

OVERVIEW
A web-based membership management system for a charity with ~500 members and ~40-50 executive committee members. The system must support hierarchical roles, member-to-executive assignment, profile management, document storage, and annual fee tracking with WhatsApp payment requests.

---

TECH STACK (recommended)
- Frontend: Next.js 14 (App Router) + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS
- Backend: Next.js API Routes or Node.js/Express
- Database: PostgreSQL with Prisma ORM
- File Storage: AWS S3 or Cloudflare R2 (for document uploads)
- Auth: NextAuth.js with role-based access control
- WhatsApp: Twilio API or WhatsApp Business API (for invoice sending)

---

USER ROLES & HIERARCHY
1. Super Admin / President
   - Full system access
   - Can appoint/remove committee members and executives
   - Can view all reports and financials

2. Secretary
   - Manage member records
   - Send payment requests
   - Generate reports

3. Central Committee Member
   - View assigned region/group data
   - Approve member applications

4. Executive Member (Lane Manager equivalent)
   - Each executive is assigned 10 members to oversee
   - Can view and update their assigned members' details
   - Can mark fee payments received
   - Can send WhatsApp payment reminders to their 10 members

5. Regular Member
   - View own profile
   - Update own contact details
   - View own payment history and receipts

---

CORE MODULES

1. MEMBER MANAGEMENT
   - Member registration form with fields:
     * Full name (English + Arabic)
     * Member ID (auto-generated)
     * Mobile number (with country code)
     * WhatsApp number (may differ from mobile)
     * Email address
     * Emirates ID / Passport number
     * Nationality
     * Date of birth
     * Residential address
     * Emergency contact
     * Date joined
     * Member status (Active / Inactive / Pending)
   - Search and filter members by name, ID, status, assigned executive
   - Bulk import via CSV/Excel

2. EXECUTIVE ASSIGNMENT (Lane Manager System)
   - ERP-style assignment interface
   - Each executive can be assigned up to 10 members
   - Visual dashboard showing:
     * Executive name
     * Assigned members list (up to 10)
     * Payment status of each member
     * Contact completeness score
   - Drag-and-drop or dropdown reassignment of members between executives
   - Alert when an executive's member count exceeds 10

3. DOCUMENT MANAGEMENT
   - Per-member document upload section
   - Supported document types:
     * Emirates ID (front + back)
     * Passport copy
     * Photo
     * Any other relevant document
   - Document preview in-browser (PDF and image)
   - Document expiry tracking (for Emirates ID / Passport)
   - Upload size limit: 5MB per file

4. ANNUAL MEMBERSHIP FEE MODULE
   - Annual fee: AED 50 per member
   - Fee year tracking (e.g., 2024-2025)
   - Payment recording:
     * Mark as Paid / Unpaid / Partial
     * Payment date
     * Payment method (Cash / Bank Transfer / Online)
     * Reference number
   - Payment history per member (all years)
   - Bulk fee status view (which members have paid / not paid)
   - Dashboard summary: Total collected, Pending amount, % paid

5. WHATSAPP INVOICE & PAYMENT REQUEST
   - Generate a clean invoice/payment request including:
     * Organization logo and name
     * Member name and ID
     * Fee amount: AED 50
     * Due date
     * Payment instructions (bank account or payment link)
     * QR code (optional)
   - Send via WhatsApp to member's registered WhatsApp number
   - Bulk send to all unpaid members (with rate limiting to avoid spam flags)
   - Track: Sent / Delivered / Read status (if using WhatsApp Business API)
   - Executive can send reminders only to their 10 assigned members
   - Secretary/Admin can do bulk send

---

DASHBOARD & REPORTS

Admin Dashboard
- Total members count
- Active vs inactive breakdown
- Fee collection: paid / unpaid / total expected
- Members with missing documents
- Members with upcoming document expiry
- Recent activity log

Executive Dashboard
- My 10 assigned members
- Fee payment status per member
- Quick-send WhatsApp reminder button per member
- Contact detail completeness warnings

Reports (exportable as PDF / Excel)
- Full member list
- Fee collection report (by year, by executive, by status)
- Members with outstanding fees
- Document expiry report
- New members added in date range

---

KEY UI/UX REQUIREMENTS
- Mobile-responsive (executives will use on phones)
- Arabic RTL support (optional but preferred)
- Simple, clean interface suitable for non-technical committee members
- Dashboard in English; member-facing content should support English and Malayalam/Arabic
- WhatsApp invoice message should be in English and Malayalam

---

SECURITY & ACCESS
- JWT-based authentication
- Role-based route protection (middleware)
- Executives can only see their 10 assigned members (data isolation)
- Audit log for all changes (who changed what, when)
- Data export only available to Admin/Secretary roles

---

DEPLOYMENT
- Hosted on VPS or cloud (AWS/DigitalOcean/Render)
- SSL certificate
- Daily automated database backup
- Environment: Production + Staging

